  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA - Support to the 10th Country Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNFPA India 10th Country Program, soft earmarked output 1, 2 and 3. 
The main objective of the UNFPAs 10th Country programme (CP10) is to support national efforts in achieving universal access to sexual and reproductive health and reproductive rights and to promote gender equality. CP 10 will stimulate efforts to end preventable maternal deaths, unmet need for family planning, and gender-based violence and harmful practices, including in humanitarian situations.</narrative>
  </description>
